{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le09ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">8 Proven Ways to Minimize Stress and Limit its Health Effects</span></br></br>\n<ol start=\"1\"><li>You Should Think Positively<br>\nResearch has shown that optimism or pessimism affects your quality of life. Optimistic thinking helps you to cope with stressful situations and minimize the effects that stress can have on your body.</li>\n</br><li>You Had Better Change Your Emotional Response<br.><br>\nPositive strategies which deal with stress help avoid negative consequences. You ought to think about stress as a reaction to a problem, rather than the problem itself.</li></ol>", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob06re2img06.jpg", "text": "<ol start=\"3\"><li>Remember to Protect Your Time<br>\nSome people find it hard to refuse requests which are made of their time. Agreeing to do everything comes at a price \u2014 less peace of mind and more stress. You need to do things you enjoy and not feel guilty about it.</li>\n<br><li>Restore Work-Life Balance<br>Stress is created when your work life and personal life feel out of balance.</li>\n<br><li>You Should Try Meditation<br>\nMeditation can reduce your stress by calming your mind. Concentration meditation is when you focus your attention on one thing, like an image you visualize or your breathing.</li></ol>", "time": "29500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob06re2img07.jpg", "text": "<ol start=\"6\"><li>You've Got to Keep Your Cool<br>Focus on how you can gain control of a situation. There are four ways to help manage stress: adapt, alter, avoid, or accept!<br><br></li>\n<li>You Need to Maintain a Solid Social Network<br>A solid social support network is a group of friends, family and peers who can help you through periods of stress. A social support network is best developed when you're not under stress. This provides the comfort of knowing you have friends when you need them.</li></ol>", "time": "65000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about solving problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express necessity, duty, and advice.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can report facts about events or actions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you feel stress in your life?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What causes stress?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What are some things that you can do to reduce stress?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Stressed out!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type